{"id":"vod_sn_38812","vodId":"38812","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"战国天堂 极","name_cn":"战国天堂 极","date":"2011-01-01","year":"2011","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"更新至第19集","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/c081532fc8669340ca1e5a879320763b.jpg"},"summary":"「战国☆天堂」的TV动画名称将叫作「战国☆天堂 极」，故事情节及将会以哪一位战国名将作为第一主角均没有详细公布，但这次的动画设定已确定由曾担任「食梦者」及「GANTZ」等作的作画监督的羽田浩二负责。既然这次的动画很明显是专为女性向而设，那众多的男性声优阵容当然少不了，从而公布的声优名单中，我们便可发现浪川大辅、柿原彻也、柿原彻也等人的名字，不过不过更多的都是小记不认识就是了。「战国☆天堂 极」已决定将在10月3号首播，让我们看看这充满美型战国武将如何在这10月新番中杀出一条血路吧。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:04:51","playable":true,"episodeCount":19,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/gRNx5vsZre1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/D3L6RHcspv1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/4UFCRd1vfp1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/x0b5NFKRR21/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/VNJUPS3BsK1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/FQgjtmbd6R1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/XqviH1ad1x1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/U6VnpP7Ai21/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/BUqv2KVQBA1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/sYrg77DFnD1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Jr1S5Qm5Nx1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/YeDGf8zyYF1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/iYeQnWk2yB1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/NvMqDXkdAj1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/0